{"id":28649,"author":"_DISTRACTION_","body":"Hello,\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe map developers have been hard at work, preparing the contest maps for the map testing events. Testing will occur at the following dates and times:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ctable class=\"highlight tab-size-8 js-file-line-container\" style=\"max-width: 100%; background-color: transparent; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; outline: 0px; border-color: rgb(134, 201, 255); box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.075) 0px 1px 1px inset, rgba(82, 168, 236, 0.6) 0px 0px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Helvetica, arial, nimbussansl, liberationsans, freesans, clean, sans-serif, \u0026quot;Segoe UI Emoji\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Segoe UI Symbol\u0026quot;;\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd class=\"blob-num js-line-number\" style=\"padding: 0px 10px; min-width: 50px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eSaturday\u003c/b\u003e, POSTPONED\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eSunday\u003c/b\u003e, POSTPONED\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eFriday\u003c/b\u003e, December 15th, at\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003e4 PM EST\u003c/b\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eThe scoring system is listed below; each map will receive a total of 120 points. For an explanation of how each category will be judged, please read the appropriate sections in \u003c/font\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003ebold\u003c/b\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e.\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; text-decoration-line: underline;\"\u003eCriteria for Judgement:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eGameplay\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eMatch Duration (\u003ci\u003eMax 20 points\u003c/i\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eEach map will receive three scores out of 20; one for each testing date. The three scores will be averaged to create a final score for this category.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e0-5 Minutes: 5 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e6-9 Minutes: 13 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e10-13 Minutes: 18 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e14-23 Minutes: 20 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e24-30 Minutes: 19 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e30-40 Minutes: 17 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e40-∞ Minutes: 16 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eAverage Judges’ Rating of Gameplay (\u003ci\u003eMax 45 points\u003c/i\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe map developers who are present at each map testing, will provide gameplay scores based on the specific map testing(s) that they witness. If a map developer is present at more than one testing, their scores will be averaged; each map developer will contribute 1 average score. The map developer scores will then be averaged for a final score in this category.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 0 and 2: 5 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 2 and 3: 10 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 3 and 4: 15 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 4 and 5: 20 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 5 and 6: 25 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 6 and 7: 35 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 8 and 9: 40 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 9 and 10: 45 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eAesthetics\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eAverage Judges’ Rating of Aesthetics (\u003ci\u003eMax 20 points\u003c/i\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eEach map developer will provide a rating for the map's aesthetics. All the ratings will be averaged together to create a final score.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 0 and 2: 2 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 2 and 3: 6 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 4 and 5: 11 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 5 and 6: 13 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 6 and 7: 15 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 7 and 10: 20 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eOriginality\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eAverage Judges’ Rating of Originality (\u003ci\u003eMax 15 points\u003c/i\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eEach map developer will provide a rating for the map's originality. All the ratings will be averaged together to create a final score.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 0 and 2: 2 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 2 and 3: 6 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 4 and 5: 8 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 5 and 6.5: 10 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 6.5 and 10: 15 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eCommunity Opinion\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eAverage Rating (\u003ci\u003eMax 20 points\u003c/i\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe community rating will be taken directly from each map's page on the website, after the third and final testing has concluded.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 0 and 1.36: 5 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 1.37 and 2.28: 7 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 2.29 and 2.80: 9 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 2.81 and 3.29: 11 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 3.30 and 3.49: 13 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 3.50 and 3.64: 16 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 3.65 and 3.73: 17 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 3.74 and 3.94: 18 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 3.95 and 4.49: 19 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 4.50 and 5.0: 20 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e/120 Points Total\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Lato, sans-serif;\"\u003eOnce all the results are collected, a thread will be posted with each map's score card. The prizes for winning are detailed in the main thread:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/discussions/7ed379db3\"\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/discussions/7ed379db3\u003c/a\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","body_tagged":"Hello,\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe map developers have been hard at work, preparing the contest maps for the map testing events. Testing will occur at the following dates and times:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ctable class=\"highlight tab-size-8 js-file-line-container\" style=\"max-width: 100%; background-color: transparent; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; outline: 0px; border-color: rgb(134, 201, 255); box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.075) 0px 1px 1px inset, rgba(82, 168, 236, 0.6) 0px 0px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Helvetica, arial, nimbussansl, liberationsans, freesans, clean, sans-serif, \u0026quot;Segoe UI Emoji\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Segoe UI Symbol\u0026quot;;\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd class=\"blob-num js-line-number\" style=\"padding: 0px 10px; min-width: 50px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eSaturday\u003c/b\u003e, POSTPONED\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eSunday\u003c/b\u003e, POSTPONED\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eFriday\u003c/b\u003e, December 15th, at\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003e4 PM EST\u003c/b\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eThe scoring system is listed below; each map will receive a total of 120 points. For an explanation of how each category will be judged, please read the appropriate sections in \u003c/font\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003ebold\u003c/b\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e.\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; text-decoration-line: underline;\"\u003eCriteria for Judgement:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eGameplay\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eMatch Duration (\u003ci\u003eMax 20 points\u003c/i\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eEach map will receive three scores out of 20; one for each testing date. The three scores will be averaged to create a final score for this category.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e0-5 Minutes: 5 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e6-9 Minutes: 13 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e10-13 Minutes: 18 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e14-23 Minutes: 20 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e24-30 Minutes: 19 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e30-40 Minutes: 17 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e40-∞ Minutes: 16 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eAverage Judges’ Rating of Gameplay (\u003ci\u003eMax 45 points\u003c/i\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe map developers who are present at each map testing, will provide gameplay scores based on the specific map testing(s) that they witness. If a map developer is present at more than one testing, their scores will be averaged; each map developer will contribute 1 average score. The map developer scores will then be averaged for a final score in this category.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 0 and 2: 5 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 2 and 3: 10 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 3 and 4: 15 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 4 and 5: 20 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 5 and 6: 25 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 6 and 7: 35 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 8 and 9: 40 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 9 and 10: 45 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eAesthetics\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eAverage Judges’ Rating of Aesthetics (\u003ci\u003eMax 20 points\u003c/i\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eEach map developer will provide a rating for the map's aesthetics. All the ratings will be averaged together to create a final score.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0pt 0px 0pt 25px;\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: transparent;\"\u003eBetween 0 and 2: 2 points\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: Calibri; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\"\u003